# MovePlatform Action Definition for CDPR Point-to-Point Motion

# Goal
geometry_msgs/Point target_position
float64 target_speed_m_s
---
# Result
bool success
string message
geometry_msgs/Point final_position
float64 final_tracking_error_m
float64 total_duration_s
---
# Feedback
geometry_msgs/Point current_position
float64 current_tracking_error_m
float64 progress_percentage
float64 time_elapsed_s
